{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:58:41+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-22T15:58:41+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Corporación Acciona Energías Renovables, S.A.","sector":"Utilities","industry":"Utilities - Renewable","country":"Spain","city":"Madrid","website":"https://www.acciona-energia.com","employees":2933,"summary":"Corporación Acciona Energías Renovables, S.A. engages in the promotion, construction, operation, maintenance, and development of renewable energy projects in Spain and internationally. The company operates onshore wind, photovoltaic solar, solar thermal, biomass, hydraulic, and energy storage renewable technology projects. It is also involved in renewable energy supply, green hydrogen, energy efficiency, electric mobility, and self-consumption decarbonization solutions. In addition, the company engages in fuel imports and exports; and sales and co-generation services, including engineering, consulting, and auditing of sites and projects, as well as drafting plans. The company was incorporated in 2008 and is headquartered in Madrid, Spain. Corporación Acciona Energías Renovables, S.A. operates as a subsidiary of Acciona, S.A.","exchange":"MCE","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"Corporacin Acciona Energas Renovables, S.A. s’engage dans la promotion, la construction, l’exploitation, la maintenance et le développement de projets d’énergie renouvelable en Espagne et à l’international. La société exploite des projets de technologie renouvelable dans les domaines de l'éolien terrestre, du solaire photovoltaïque, du solaire thermique, de la biomasse, de l'hydraulique et du stockage d'énergie. Il est également impliqué dans l'approvisionnement en énergie renouvelable, l'hydrogène vert, l'efficacité énergétique, la mobilité électrique et les solutions de décarbonisation par autoconsommation."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo"